        "Wilhelmus   lantgravius Thuringie et marchio Misnen. [Misnensis] || de lic. [licentia / licentiatus] facere celebrare in locis interd.; de esu carnium pro monachis o. [obitus / ordo] Cist. [ordo Cisterciensis] ad mensam suam venientibus; de indulg. [indulgentia / indulgere] pro eccl. [ecclesia] colleg. [collegiata ecclesia] in Aldenburg Merseburg. [Merseburgensis] (!) dioc.; de conf. [confirmare / confirmatio] indulg. [indulgentia / indulgere] etc. [et cetera] concessarum p. [per / parvus / purus / prebenda] Bonifatium IX pro eccl. [ecclesia] colleg. [collegiata ecclesia] b. [beatus / bulla] Marie in castro Aldenburg Nuemburg. [Nuemburgensis] (!) dioc. [diocesis] 30 dec. [decanus / december] 1424 S 182 191."@la .

